			title: " Forge Rocket Complete: Congrats on Pack Completion!"
			x: 2.0d
			y: -18.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"&7Forged through countless hours of automation, exploration, engineering, and discovery, the &6Forge Rocket&r represents the pinnacle of technological achievement.&r"
				""
				"This is not simply another rocket."
				""
				"It is the culmination of everything you have learned throughout your journey."
				""
				"From your first mechanical contraptions to sprawling industrial complexes, every challenge, every planet, and every factory has led to this moment."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Ultimate Achievement&r:"
				""
				"Constructing the Forge Rocket is no small feat. It requires advanced materials gathered from across the solar system, mastery of complex production chains, and the full power of your automation network."
				""
				"Only those who have conquered the stars, defeated powerful foes, and mastered industrial engineering will possess the knowledge and resources necessary to complete it."
				""
				"The Forge Rocket stands as proof that you have overcome every obstacle placed before you."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"More than any boss, planet, or machine, the Forge Rocket serves as the ultimate symbol of your accomplishments."
				""
				"It is the final milestone of your adventure—a testament to your creativity, perseverance, and engineering skill."
				""
				"As the engines ignite for the final time, take a moment to look back at everything you have built."
				""
				"The factory is complete."
				""
				"The stars have been conquered."
				""
				"And your legacy has been forged."
			]
