			description: [
				"&nForge Rocket Casing 1/18&r"
				""
				"&7The &6Forge Rocket Casing&r is the backbone of the &6Forge Rocket&r and one of the largest resource sinks in the entire pack.&r"
				""
				"Each casing requires enormous quantities of materials sourced from across your adventure, making large-scale automation and resource production essential."
